@chapter 27 | Genetic, Deficiency and Other Diseases; Plant Diseases

@intro
This chapter covers diseases that are not infections: **genetic disorders** (haemophilia, colour blindness, SCID), **deficiency** and lifestyle diseases (goitre, beriberi, gout, osteoporosis, diabetes, cirrhosis, kwashiorkor), **pollution diseases** (blue baby, knock-knee, Minamata, itai-itai), **radioisotopes in medicine**, cancer and brain disorders, **eye defects**, and medical terms (MRI, BMD, EEG, CPR, cath lab). The last part covers **plant diseases** of crops. It contains **{pyqs} PYQs and {ones} one-liners**.
@end

@section 27.1 | Genetic Disorders

@q 52:1-3

@table
Genetic disorder | Feature
**Haemophilia** ("royal disease", Queen Victoria's descendants) | **X-linked**; blood does not clot (clotting factor VIII or IX missing)
**Colour blindness** | **X-linked**; red-green confusion; not caused by any vitamin deficiency
**SCID** ("bubble baby disease") | Severe combined immunodeficiency; the child is kept in a germ-free plastic bubble; first gene therapy (1990)
**Albinism** | No **melanin** pigment
**Sickle-cell anaemia** | Faulty haemoglobin; common in tribal belts (National Sickle Cell Anaemia Elimination Mission, 2023)
Thalassaemia | Low haemoglobin production
Down syndrome | Extra chromosome 21
@end

@q 52:4-5

An X-linked recessive trait passes from an affected **man** to all his **daughters as carriers** (sons get his Y and are normal); a carrier daughter then passes it to half her **sons**. So colour blindness skips a generation and shows in the **daughter's sons** (the man's grandsons).

@section 27.2 | Deficiency and Lifestyle Diseases

@q 53:1-6

**Gout** (a form of arthritis) is caused by **uric acid crystals** in joints. **Epidemic dropsy** comes from mustard oil adulterated with **argemone oil** (sanguinarine). **Goitre** (thyroid swelling) is due to **iodine** deficiency; **beriberi** due to vitamin B_{1}, common with **polished rice**.

@q 53:8-11

@q 53:13-15

**BMD** (bone mineral density) scans detect **osteoporosis**. **Bulimia** is binge eating; **anorexia** is self-starvation. **Anosmia** is loss of smell (common after COVID-19). **Sleep apnoea** is repeated stopping of breathing during sleep. **Potassium** keeps the heartbeat steady; its lack causes muscle weakness and low blood pressure. **Albumin** in urine (proteinuria) signals **kidney** damage.

