@q 53:50-53

@table
Disease | Organ / cause
**Diabetes mellitus** | **Pancreas** (too little insulin, or insulin resistance); monitored by **HbA1c**; cannot be prevented by a vaccine
**Liver cirrhosis** | Scarring of the liver from **alcohol** or hepatitis
**Oral submucous fibrosis** | Mouth; caused by **gutka**, areca nut and tobacco chewing
**Bright's disease** | **Kidney** inflammation (nephritis)
**Emphysema** | **Lungs** (smoking, air pollution; a form of COPD)
**Mad cow disease** (BSE) | Brain; caused by **prions** (misfolded proteins)
**Cerebral palsy** | Movement disorder from brain damage in **small children**
**Alzheimer's** | Brain; **amyloid** plaques from amyloid precursor protein
@end

