@table
Crop | Disease / disorder | Cause
**Rice** | Brown leaf spot (Bengal famine 1943), blast, **false smut**, **Khaira** | Fungi; Khaira = **zinc** deficiency
Rice | **Tungro** | Virus spread by **green leafhoppers**
**Wheat** | **Black / brown / yellow rust**, **Karnal bunt**, loose smut | Fungi
Wheat | Ear cockle | Nematode
Wheat weed | *Phalaris minor* (gulli danda) | Weed, not a disease
**Sugarcane** | **Red rot** | Fungus
**Potato** | **Late blight** (Irish famine 1845) | Fungus-like *Phytophthora*
Potato | **Black heart** | **Oxygen deficiency** in storage
Bajra (pearl millet) | **Ergot**, **green ear**, smut | Fungi
Pigeon pea, gram | **Wilt** | Fungus (*Fusarium*)
Groundnut | **Tikka** (leaf spot) | Fungus
Mustard | White rust | Fungus-like
Pea | Powdery mildew | Fungus
**Okra** | **Yellow vein mosaic** | Virus spread by **whitefly**
**Citrus** | **Canker** | Bacterium
Maize | Chlorosis / white bud | **Zinc** deficiency
**Mango (Alphonso)** | **Spongy tissue** | Physiological disorder (heat)
@end

@trap
**Haemophilia and colour blindness are X-linked**; colour blindness shows in the **daughter's sons**. **Gout = uric acid.** **Blue baby = nitrate** (methaemoglobin), **knock-knee = fluoride**, **Minamata = mercury**, **itai-itai = cadmium**. **I-131 thyroid, Co-60 cancer, P-32 leukaemia, Na-24 blood flow, As-74 tumours.** **Atropine** dilates the pupil. **Cataract affects the lens.** **Khaira = zinc.** **Tungro by leafhopper, okra mosaic by whitefly.** **Spongy tissue = Alphonso.**
@end

@heatmap

@pattern
These questions span 30 years with steady repetition of radioisotopes, pollution diseases and medical full forms. Newer papers (2021-2024) asked about blue baby syndrome, knock-knee, Minamata, CPR, diabetes and plant diseases, often as multi-pair matches.
@end

@next
Likely next angles: the **Sickle Cell Anaemia Elimination Mission**, **gene therapy** for haemophilia (India's first trial, 2024), **CAR-T** cancer therapy, **non-communicable disease** screening, **fluoride and arsenic** in UP groundwater (Jal Jeevan Mission testing), **Alzheimer's** drugs, and **wheat blast** and **locust** threats to crops.
@end
